1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,323
How does a hummingbird survive a cold night without food?

2
00:00:03,553 --> 00:00:08,636
It burns energy so fast that staying warm until morning could use up its fat.

3
00:00:08,786 --> 00:00:10,250
So it does the opposite.

4
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,126
It goes still and lets its body go cold.

5
00:00:13,316 --> 00:00:17,546
Its heartbeat drops from about 1,200 a minute to as low as 40.

6
00:00:17,716 --> 00:00:21,775
One black metaltail cooled to 3.3 degrees Celsius.

7
00:00:21,865 --> 00:00:23,213
That's fridge cold.

8
00:00:23,303 --> 00:00:25,381
No bird has been measured colder.
